=2 Walkthrough
* Receive the mission from {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.
* Join {p:Campaign Battles|Category:Campaign Battle} in {p:Dark Kindred|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Kindred} controlled areas.
* After completing the Objective, report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
* To complete this mission you MUST participate in Campaign battles in Beastmen controlled zones.
* You need 5000 EXP to complete this Campaign Op.
* You will receive your mission reward along with the Campaign battle assessment immediately after your objective has been completed.

=2 Game Description
\**Client:** {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} - {z:Windurst Waters (S)} (H-9)
\**Summary:** The federation has set plans in motion to carry out attacks on Beastman Confederate strongholds in a series of strategic Campaign battles. Assist the mercenaries of the Cobra Unit in the siege of these key tactical poisitions.
